Chapter XII: ## MEETINGS OF BOARD AND ITS POWERS | Section 180: Restrictions on powers of Board.** —( _1_ ) The Board of Directors of a company shall exercise the following powers only with the consent of the company by a special resolution, namely:—

**180. Restrictions on powers of Board.** —( _1_ ) The Board of Directors of a company shall exercise the following powers only with the consent of the company by a special resolution, namely:—

